  "S04-C": {
   "caption": "Martial arts can burn calories, challenge your cardio and give you a reason to keep showing up. It is a great way to stay active, build fitness and support getting leaner. But I would not use it as a replacement for weight training. Lifting builds and maintains the muscle you want to keep as you lose fat. Pair the two, leave room to recover, and keep your food intake aligned with your goal. Train your conditioning and your strength.\n\nReal studio photograph of me. The background was created with AI.",
   "title": "Train martial arts. Lift weights too.",
